# Alpine Linux Dotfiles (Labwc)

**Riccardo Palombo** - email at riccardo dot im
**Video:** https://youtu.be/RGR3gQSStIA

#  Optimized for 1920x1200 display. Based on Alpine Linux.

## Main
Labwc (with "RP" theme)
Waybar
Foot
Fish Shell
Firefox
Gram (Zed Editor Fork)
PCManfm-Qt (desktop icons)
Fuzzel
Mako
Nwg-Look
QT6CT
Tlp
Tlp-pd

## UI
CozetteVector Fonts
Font Awesome
Haiku Icons
Capitaine Cursors

## Copy dotfiles
cp -r home/. /home/$USER

## Fix script permissions
chmod +x ~/.config/scripts/*

Happy ricing!
